@startuml

title Trade states through a report run

state "Booked" as Booked
state "Incomplete" as Incomplete
state "Excluded" as Excluded
state "Complete" as Complete
state "Submitted" as Submitted
state "Valued" as Valued
state "Failed" as Failed
state "Recorded" as Recorded
state "Not recorded" as Unrecorded

[*] --> Booked : preprocessing\nreads the trade
Booked --> Incomplete : an address\nno series answers
Booked --> Complete : every address\nanswered at the as-of
Incomplete --> Excluded : the run records\nits causes
Complete --> Submitted : submission\nhands it to the grid
Submitted --> Failed : the engine\nrefuses it
Submitted --> Valued : the engine\nprices it
Valued --> Recorded : postprocessing\nwrites the row
Valued --> Unrecorded : postprocessing\ncannot write it
Failed --> [*] : postprocessing\nrecords the error
Recorded --> [*]
Unrecorded --> [*]
Excluded --> [*]

legend right
  A trade is excluded or failed, never both.
  An engine failure is a trade whose market data was complete.
end legend
@enduml
